  "description": "<h3 data-end=\"40\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"38\" data-start=\"4\">BabyGains &ndash; Brand Introduction</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"173\" data-start=\"42\"><strong data-end=\"66\" data-start=\"42\">Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"69\" data-start=\"66\">Gym-inspired baby and toddler toys designed for active play. Safe, durable, and fun for little movers.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"203\" data-start=\"175\"><strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"175\">Unique Selling Points:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"204\">\r\n<li data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"204\"><strong data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"206\">Real gym look &amp; feel</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Just like mom and dad&rsquo;s equipment.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"333\" data-start=\"270\"><strong data-end=\"295\" data-start=\"272\">Encourages movement</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Builds coordination and strength.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"397\" data-start=\"334\"><strong data-end=\"354\" data-start=\"336\">Safe &amp; durable</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Non-toxic, impact-resistant materials.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"398\"><strong data-end=\"427\" data-start=\"400\">Perfect for fit parents</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Play and train together.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"478\" data-start=\"458\"><strong data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"458\">Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"479\">\r\n<li data-end=\"529\" data-start=\"479\">Secure checkout (Credit Card, PayPal, Klarna).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"530\">Affiliates earn&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"570\" data-start=\"548\">up to $35 per sale</strong>&nbsp;(payouts every 30 days).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"598\">Wholesale pricing available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"649\" data-start=\"632\"><strong data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"632\">Other Info:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"743\" data-start=\"650\">\r\n<li data-end=\"673\" data-start=\"650\">Worldwide shipping.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"674\">Limited stock due to high demand.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"743\" data-start=\"712\">Dedicated customer support.</li>\r\n</ul>",
